        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "忽然 + event",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "忽然 introduces an abrupt change or event. It does not imply that the event was planned.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "天忽然冷了。",
                "pinyin": "tiān hūrán lěng le 。",
                "meaning": "The weather suddenly became cold.",
                "audio": "b02ebca3cec395f769250ad2332f38b87b5bf72332755651c87db6f56556794d"
              },
              {
                "text": "他忽然站起来。",
                "pinyin": "tā hūrán zhàn qǐlái 。",
                "meaning": "He suddenly stood up.",
                "audio": "6edaa74b5d7379032b07e8fa4c93fe67b34f2acec4ca012578690a305921e853"
